# sdd-flow session state for THIS repo. On macOS's case-insensitive filesystem,
# SDD/orchestration/ (SDD/.records/ since agent-engineering 4.7.0) physically lands inside the frozen `sdd` plugin directory
# (sdd/orchestration/) — never commit it into the plugin. Both spellings listed
# so the rule also holds on case-sensitive clones.
/SDD/orchestration/
/sdd/orchestration/
/SDD/.records/
/sdd/.records/
